NOTICE -- third-party software used by e2e/interconnect_surrogate/
==================================================================

This subpackage is a thin wrapper. It contains no upstream source code and no
upstream model weights; it calls the `tessera-tsv` package, which must be
installed separately (see requirements-tessera.txt). This NOTICE is carried
because BSD 3-Clause clause 2 requires the copyright notice, the conditions and
the disclaimer to be reproduced "in the documentation and/or other materials
provided with the distribution".

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tessera / TSV_PhGNN -- physics-informed GNN surrogate for TSV-network
S-parameters, steady-state thermal, closed EM-thermal coupling, and Ansys
HFSS<->Mechanical sign-off.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/HiPerCAS/tessera
  Package:   tessera-tsv (version 1.1.0; pinned here at commit e53bb88)
  Authors:   Mohamed Gharib, Leonid Popryho, Inna Partin-Vaisband
             (HiPerCAS Lab, University of Illinois Chicago)
