What is NOT covered by the public release
-----------------------------------------
* The training dataset (upstream: "not ours to redistribute").
* The HFSS-finetuned checkpoint that produced
  e2e/data/interconnect/tessera_tsv_s21.csv. The public checkpoint
  models/best_model.pth is a DIFFERENT instrument and does not reproduce that
  file (about -0.57 dB vs -7.48 dB at 30 GHz, measured 2026-09-23).
* The 77 GHz automotive HFSS projects behind
  e2e/data/interconnect/tessera_case{1..6}_s21_77ghz.csv. Those are a different
  structure and are not producible by this package at all.
